## Loop Engineering (LoopKit)
For every non-trivial task, follow `.loop/LOOP.md`. Read the spine in `.loop/` first, define a measurable
goal, iterate Goal -> Action -> Observe -> Adjust, persist state each iteration, and end with the
Handoff Report. Do not claim checks passed unless you ran them. Never run production-affecting
commands without explicit human approval.
<!-- loopkit:end -->
